  {
   "id": "crush-polyglot-md-13",
   "kind": {
    "type": "markdown"
   },
   "source": "Listing a name the block never binds is a compile error; a name bound only on\nsome paths is a run-time error naming it (`output variable 'r' was not bound by\nthe block`), never a silent `null`:\n",
   "state": {
    "status": "done"
   },
   "meta": {},
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "id": "crush-polyglot-7",
   "kind": {
    "type": "crush"
   },
   "source": "fn main() {\n    @python -> missing {\n    x = 1\n    }\n    print(missing)\n}\n",
   "state": {
    "status": "pending"
   },
   "meta": {
    "tags": [
     "guide",
     "expected-failure"
    ],
    "extra": {
     "guide": {
      "src": "crush/polyglot.md:172",
      "browser": "fail",
      "why": "this example shows a compile error"
     }
    }
